WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.114 --> 00:00:17.318
Mrs. Rabbit gave Jeremy some tea.

2
00:00:17.319 --> 00:00:20.287
"Drink this," she said.

3
00:00:20.288 --> 00:00:22.503
"It is medicine."

4
00:00:22.504 --> 00:00:27.293
Jeremy sipped the tea.

5
00:00:27.294 --> 00:00:29.656
"Yuck!" he thought.

6
00:00:29.657 --> 00:00:36.457
"This tea tastes terrible!"

7
00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.301
No one was looking at Jeremy.

8
00:00:39.302 --> 00:00:41.354
He quickly dumped the tea.

9
00:00:41.355 --> 00:00:43.982
"Finished!" he called.

10
00:00:43.983 --> 00:00:46.304
"Oh!" Mrs. Rabbit said.

11
00:00:46.305 --> 00:00:48.162
"That was quick."

12
00:00:48.163 --> 00:00:53.923
Suddenly Mrs. Rabbit spotted a puddle.

13
00:00:53.924 --> 00:00:57.765
Rain dripped through a window.

14
00:00:57.766 --> 00:01:01.651
"No wonder you are sick," she said.

15
00:01:01.652 --> 00:01:04.591
"Your house is wet!"

16
00:01:04.592 --> 00:01:12.513
Jemima cut her cake.

17
00:01:12.514 --> 00:01:18.444
She gave some to Ribby and Mrs. Rabbit.

18
00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.579
Jeremy frowned.

19
00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:24.652
"May I have some cake?" he asked.

20
00:01:24.653 --> 00:01:27.196
"Sorry," Jemima said.

21
00:01:27.197 --> 00:01:29.873
"I didn't know you had a cold.

22
00:01:29.874 --> 00:01:32.374
Sugar is bad for colds.

23
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:39.670
So I will make some soup."

24
00:01:39.671 --> 00:01:42.015
Ribby opened a book.

25
00:01:42.016 --> 00:01:44.327
"And I will read to you.

26
00:01:44.328 --> 00:01:47.338
Reading will make you feel better."

27
00:01:47.339 --> 00:01:53.082
Ribby started reading. "Once upon a time . . ."

28
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:54.947
Jeremy blushed.

29
00:01:54.948 --> 00:02:00.184
His heart thumped.

30
00:02:00.185 --> 00:02:02.120
But he didn't feel better.

31
00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.274
He felt worse.

32
00:02:04.275 --> 00:02:06.731
Ribby was looking at him.

33
00:02:06.732 --> 00:02:18.012
And his nose was red and runny!
